[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2149531363","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495#issuecomment-2149531363","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495","id":2149531363,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86AHz7j","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T11:06:52Z","updated_at":"2024-06-05T11:06:52Z","body":"Text of requested license exception to add:\r\n\r\n```\r\nIf you modify this Program, or any covered work, by linking or\r\ncombining it with runtime libraries of Erlang/OTP as released by\r\nEricsson on http://www.erlang.org (or a modified version of these\r\nlibraries), containing parts covered by the terms of the Erlang Public\r\nLicense (http://www.erlang.org/EPLICENSE), the licensors of this\r\nProgram grant you additional permission to convey the resulting work\r\nwithout the need to license the runtime libraries of Erlang/OTP under\r\nthe GNU Affero General Public License. Corresponding Source for a\r\nnon-source form of such a combination shall include the source code\r\nfor the parts of the runtime libraries of Erlang/OTP used as well as\r\nthat of the covered work.\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2149531363/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2149569306","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495#issuecomment-2149569306","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495","id":2149569306,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86AH9Ma","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T11:16:13Z","updated_at":"2024-06-05T11:16:26Z","body":"This exception is close to [`GPL-3.0-linking-source-exception`](https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-linking-source-exception.html), taking into account the replaceable text bits of that exception.\r\n\r\nHowever, it does add an additional phrase that isn't present in `GPL-3.0-linking-source-exception`:\r\n\r\n> . . . without the need to license the runtime libraries of Erlang/OTP under the GNU Affero General Public License.\r\n\r\nI'm not inclined to add that phrase as markup to `GPL-3.0-linking-source-exception`, since that exception is [based on a template taken from the FSF's FAQ](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-faq.en.html#GPLIncompatibleLibs).\r\n\r\nSo I'm +1 to add this as a new exception on the license list.\r\n\r\nI'm fine with the identifier proposed above (`erlang-otp-linking-exception`).\r\n\r\nFor the full name of the exception, I'd suggest tweaking it slightly to something like \"Erlang/OTP AGPL-3.0 Linking Exception\", for alignment with similarly-named items on the [Exceptions List](https://spdx.org/licenses/exceptions-index.html) (e.g. \"OCaml LGPL Linking Exception\").","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2149569306/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2149574549","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495#issuecomment-2149574549","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495","id":2149574549,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86AH-eV","user":{"login":"laf0rge","id":1250205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTAyMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1250205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge","html_url":"https://github.com/laf0rge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laf0rge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T11:17:39Z","updated_at":"2024-06-05T11:17:39Z","body":"I just noticed: The http:// URLs in the exception text should probably be replaced with https:// by now (they work as https, as I checked).  I'll update them in the source code shortly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2149574549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2149658707","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495#issuecomment-2149658707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495","id":2149658707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86AITBT","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T12:00:51Z","updated_at":"2024-06-05T12:00:51Z","body":"Thanks @laf0rge! For SPDX purposes, it doesn't matter whether it is http or https; the [SPDX matching guidelines (B.14)](https://spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/v2.3/license-matching-guidelines-and-templates/#b14-http-protocol) state that they should be treated as equivalent for license matching purposes. So it's fine to update them in the license text, but it shouldn't affect what gets added to the SPDX License List itself.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2149658707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2181220158","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495#issuecomment-2181220158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495","id":2181220158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86CAsc-","user":{"login":"copernicat","id":111796332,"node_id":"U_kgDOBqngbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111796332?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat","html_url":"https://github.com/copernicat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copernicat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-20T17:46:07Z","updated_at":"2024-06-20T17:46:07Z","body":"+1 I agree with @swinslow's analysis. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2181220158/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2218765927","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495#issuecomment-2218765927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495","id":2218765927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86EP65n","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-09T21:31:34Z","updated_at":"2024-07-09T21:32:28Z","body":"**{metæffekt} Universe**\r\ncanonical name: [Erlang Linking Exception (AGPL; with source provision obligation)](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[e]/README.md#user-content-Erlang-Linking-Exception-(AGPL;with-source-provision-obligation):~:text=Erlang%20Linking%20Exception%20(AGPL;%20with%20source%20provision%20obligation))\r\nshort name: Linking-Exception-AGPL-source\r\nmarkers: Extended Source Obligation Marker\r\ncategory: Erlang Linking Exception\r\nOSI status: _none_\r\n\r\n**Comment**\r\nThese multiple relationship exceptions give me headaches. There is the library (here Erlang/OTP), the license (here Erlang Public License) of the library, a secondary license (here AGPL) and an additional obligation.\r\nLooking forward to the discussion on this one in the legal call. \r\nAgain a +1 from my side to add as separate exception due to to the induced risk of the extensive source provisioning obligation.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2218765927/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2249386230","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495#issuecomment-2249386230","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495","id":2249386230,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86GEuj2","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-25T04:47:52Z","updated_at":"2024-07-25T04:47:56Z","body":"# License Inclusion Decision\r\n\r\n## Decision:\r\n\r\n- [x] approved\r\n- [ ] not approved\r\n\r\n## Name\r\nErlang/OTP AGPL-3.0 Linking Exception\r\n## License ID\r\nerlang-otp-linking-exception\r\n## XML markup\r\nI don't think we need any at this point. Can always add for the name later if other entities use this\r\n## Notes:\r\nThis exception is generally used with AGPL-3.0\r\n## Next steps ##\r\nIf the license has been accepted, please follow [the accepted-license process to create the PR](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/request-new-license.md#accepted-license-process). ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2249386230/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2249387019","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495#issuecomment-2249387019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2495","id":2249387019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86GEuwL","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.